OL,3,GNEWSA'Resilient' cat's return inspires 
OL,4,Akitten nursery                         
OL,6,FThe safe return of a "resilient" cat   
OL,7,Fwho was found 160 miles away from home 
OL,8,Fwith two young kittens has inspired a  
OL,9,Fnew nursery shelter at an animal       
OL,10,Fcharity.                               
OL,12,FMini and her kitties turned up at a    
OL,13,Fgarden shed in Darlington about 14     
OL,14,Fmonths after she disappeared from      
OL,15,FStoke-on-Trent on 30 March last year.  
OL,17,FThe trio were taken in by National     
OL,18,FAnimal Sanctuary Support League (NASSL)
OL,19,Fin Hunwick, near Bishop Auckland, who  
OL,20,Fhad her microchip scanned and were able
OL,21,Fto reunite her with her owner.         
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
